egin="3:26.842" end="3:29.402">na mi da</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Mr. &quot;Broken Heart&quot;"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="松下優也"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鳥海雄介"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="中村仁"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOUYA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="I AM ME"/><amll:meta key="album" value="U 〜BEST of BEST〜"/><amll:meta key="album" value="アイアムミー (I AM ME)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPES00801782"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536269219"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536261607"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="22746816"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="26089264"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1Iqatfo5FJV2nMrqL6pWmr"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="5HiXRaiWuQutAefPcKN5C0"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="268477608"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="2635602"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="96868062"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Shomi-FJS"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:29.402"><div begin="20.540" end="3:29.402"><p begin="20.540" end="29.386" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.540" end="20.922">今</span><span begin="20.922" end="21.180">日</span><span begin="21.180" end="22.100">も</span> <span begin="22.100" end="22.815">捜</span><span begin="22.815" end="23.022">し</span><span begin="23.022" end="23.280">て</span><span begin="23.280" end="23.586">い</span><span begin="23.586" end="25.310">た</span> <span begin="25.557" end="26.108">君</span><span begin="26.108" end="26.372">の</span><span begin="26.372" end="26.736">ま</span><span begin="26.736" end="27.019">ぼ</span><span begin="27.019" end="27.198">ろ</span><span begin="27.198" end="29.386">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时至今日 我也一直在追寻 你的幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyo u mo sa ga shi te i ta ki mi no ma bo ro shi</span></p><p begin="30.527" end="38.338" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.527" end="30.889">ひ</span><span begin="30.889" end="31.062">と</span><span begin="31.062" end="32.133">り</span> <span begin="32.133" end="32.721">交</span><span begin="32.721" end="32.922">差</span><span begin="32.922" end="33.476">点</span><span begin="33.476" end="34.941">で</span> <span begin="35.163" end="35.693">影</span><span begin="35.693" end="36.168">を</span><span begin="36.168" end="36.320">追</span><span begin="36.320" end="36.609">い</span><span begin="36.609" end="36.919">か</span><span begin="36.919" end="37.257">け</span><span begin="37.257" end="38.338">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只身一人 站在十字路口 追逐着你的影子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi to ri ko u sa te n de ka ge wo o i ka ke ru</span></p><p begin="38.490" end="40.949" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.490" end="38.908">I</span> <span begin="38.908" end="39.410">cannot</span> <span begin="39.410" end="39.829">say</span> <span begin="40.158" end="40.158">“</span><span begin="39.829" end="40.949">Goodbye”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说不出口的再见</span></p><p begin="41.109" end="43.444" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.109" end="41.403">I</span> <span begin="41.403" end="41.890">cannot</span> <span begin="41.890" end="42.328">sleep</span> <span begin="42.328" end="43.444">“tonight”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无法入眠的今夜</span></p><p begin="43.572" end="48.241" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.572" end="44.192">君</span><span begin="44.192" end="44.485">と</span><span begin="44.485" end="44.836">逢</span><span begin="44.836" end="45.363">い</span><span begin="45.363" end="45.603">た</span><span begin="45.603" end="45.752">い</span> <span begin="45.897" end="46.313">I</span> <span begin="46.313" end="46.678">am</span> <span begin="46.678" end="47.244">“Broken</span> <span begin="47.244" end="48.241">Heart”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想见你的心情 无数次令我心碎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi to a i ta i I am “Broken Heart”</span></p><p begin="48.392" end="53.341" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.392" end="49.170">Touching</span> <span begin="49.170" end="49.399">you</span> <span begin="49.399" end="50.387">今</span><span begin="50.387" end="50.983">は</span> <span begin="50.983" end="51.489">許</span><span begin="51.489" end="51.933">さ</span><span begin="51.933" end="52.249">れ</span><span begin="52.249" end="52.714">な</span><span begin="52.714" end="53.341">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">至今 我仍未得到赦免 无法触及你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Touching you i ma wa yu ru sa re na i</span></p><p begin="53.455" end="1:00.440" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.455" end="54.075">後</span><span begin="54.075" end="54.582">悔</span><span begin="54.582" end="55.278">さ</span><span begin="55.278" end="55.936">え</span> <span begin="55.936" end="56.577">伝</span><span begin="56.577" end="56.869">え</span><span begin="56.869" end="57.155">ら</span><span begin="57.155" end="57.820">れ</span><span begin="57.820" end="58.131">な</span><span begin="58.131" end="58.433">い</span><span begin="58.433" end="1:00.440">涙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">后悔莫及 只剩无法传达给你的泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko u ka i sa e tsu ta e ra re na i na mi da</span></p><p begin="1:00.751" end="1:06.475" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.751" end="1:01.121">さ</span><span begin="1:01.121" end="1:01.518">よ</span><span begin="1:01.518" end="1:01.837">な</span><span begin="1:01.837" end="1:02.411">ら</span><span begin="1:02.411" end="1:03.694">は</span> <span begin="1:03.992" end="1:04.312">ま</span><span begin="1:04.312" end="1:04.489">だ</span><span begin="1:04.489" end="1:04.895">埋</span><span begin="1:04.895" end="1:05.139">め</span><span begin="1:05.139" end="1:05.538">ら</span><span begin="1:05.538" end="1:05.705">れ</span><span begin="1:05.705" end="1:06.162">な</span><span begin="1:06.162" end="1:06.475">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang